== Conflict found after the plan was written, before any B5 code ==
test-data/reference/cpic_expectations.json (the independent expectation behind the 105-row mapping validation,
a release-gate prerequisite) already holds the 12 warfarin rows. Its rule, derived only from CPIC's structured
fields, reads: "an algorithm pointer -> Unknown". All 12 rows: expected_label Unknown, basis "CPIC states no
actionable recommendation for this combination"; the engine also gives Unknown (rule fallback_unmatched), so they
currently match. AC2 ("Adjust Dosage" when CYP2C9 and VKORC1 are both covered and called), which follows the
owner's brief, therefore contradicts an existing independent check and is exactly an honest-Unknown -> confident
change (standing rule 5). Not resolved here: put to the owner before any label change.
Parts that do not depend on the label (VKORC1/CYP4F2 parsing and gating, the additive per-gene contract,
warning scoping) may proceed meanwhile.

